        "heading": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "Discover a taste of the Scottish Highlands on your North Coast 500 journey.",
            "size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Looking to experience Dunrobin Gin in person and discover the landscape and heritage behind our Highland spirit?</p><p>You can visit us at The Wee Gin Shop, situated in the car park, at the entrance to&nbsp;Dunrobin Castle&nbsp;in Golspie, Sutherland, during the Castle's visitor season between spring and autumn.&nbsp;</p><p>While Dunrobin Highland Distillery itself is a working production site and isn't currently open for public tours, The Wee Gin Shop offers the perfect opportunity to discover our gin, meet our friendly team and take in the beautiful surroundings of Dunrobin Castle, with views across its gardens and towards the Moray Firth.</p><p>Whether you're visiting Dunrobin Castle, exploring the North Highlands or travelling along the&nbsp;North Coast 500, we'd love to welcome you.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading",
