    "route": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "Experience Dunrobin Gin at The Wee Gin Shop",
            "size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The Wee Gin Shop is all part of the North Highland experience.</p><p>Pull up a seat in our gin garden and enjoy a refreshing Dunrobin Gin and tonic, discover one of our Highland-inspired cocktails, or choose a mocktail for the designated driver.</p><p>Our team are always happy to share more about Dunrobin Highland Distillery,&nbsp;<a href=\"/blogs/news/the-story-behind-dunrobin-highland-distillery-dunrobin-gin\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"The Story Behind Dunrobin Highland Distillery | Dunrobin Gin\">the story behind our gin</a> and the botanicals that make it distinctive.</p><p>You can also explore our collection of Dunrobin Gin bottles, premium gift sets, locally handmade chocolates and branded gifts, offering a little taste of Sutherland to take home.</p><p>And with Dunrobin Castle as your backdrop and the beautiful East Sutherland coastline stretching beyond, can you imagine a better way to round off your visit?</p>"
          }
        }
      },
