    "image_with_text_86qirB": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_74QLep": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "A Scottish Gin Stop on the North Coast 500",
            "size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_fj9qty": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Planning a road trip along Scotland's famous North Coast 500?</p><p>Situated just off the A9 at Dunrobin Castle, near Golspie, The Wee Gin Shop offers a welcoming stop on your journey through Sutherland and the North Highlands.</p><p>Whether you're heading north towards Brora and Caithness or travelling south along the coast towards Inverness, you can call in to discover a locally produced Scottish gin inspired by the very landscape you're exploring.</p><p>With our range of 20cl and 70cl bottles, gift sets and handmade chocolates, there's plenty to discover, even if you're simply stopping by to pick up a souvenir of your Highland adventure.&nbsp;</p><p>And for those behind the wheel, our selection of mocktails means there's something for everyone to enjoy before continuing their NC500 journey.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
