    "faq": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "hours": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Where is The Wee Gin Shop?",
            "content": "<p>The Wee Gin Shop is situated beside the main entrance to Dunrobin Castle in Golspie, Sutherland, in the Scottish Highlands.&nbsp;</p><p>You'll find us within the main Castle car park, meaning you can visit the shop without purchasing admission to Dunrobin Castle itself.</p><p><strong>Address:&nbsp;</strong>The Wee Gin Shop, Dunrobin Castle, Golspie, Sutherland, KW10 6SF.</p><p><strong>What3Words:&nbsp;</strong>///potions.towel.rents</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
            "page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "where": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How do I get to The Wee Gin Shop?",
            "content": "<p>The Wee Gin Shop is easily accessible from the A9, between Golspie and Brora, making it a convenient stop when exploring the North Coast 500.</p><p>Follow the signs for Dunrobin Castle and continue along the main drive towards the Castle car park. You'll find The Wee Gin Shop and our gin garden beside the Castle entrance.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "online": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What are The Wee Gin Shop's opening hours?",
            "content": "<p>The Wee Gin Shop is open seven days a week during the visitor season.</p><p><strong>April to September:</strong>&nbsp;10am–5pm</p><p><strong>October:</strong>&nbsp;10:30am–4:30pm</p><p><strong>November to March:</strong>&nbsp;Closed for the winter season.</p><p>Although The Wee Gin Shop closes during the winter months, you can still purchase Dunrobin Gin, chocolates and gift sets through our&nbsp;<a href=\"/collections/all\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"All products\">online shop</a>, with UK delivery available.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "item_d3xVdi": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Do I need a ticket to Dunrobin Castle to visit The Wee Gin Shop?",
            "content": "<p>No! The Wee Gin Shop is situated in the main car park beside the Castle entrance, so you can visit us without purchasing an admission ticket to Dunrobin Castle.</p><p>Of course, if you're planning to explore the Castle, gardens and museum during your visit to Golspie, The Wee Gin Shop is the perfect place to round off your day.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "item_LPzbqt": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is The Wee Gin Shop a good stop on the North Coast 500?",
            "content": "<p>Absolutely! Situated at Dunrobin Castle, just off the A9 in Golspie, The Wee Gin Shop is an ideal stop for anyone travelling the North Coast 500 through Sutherland.</p><p>Whether you're stopping for a refreshing mocktail, discovering locally made Scottish gin or picking up a gift to enjoy later in your journey, you're always welcome to call in.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "item_UpxFeU": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I buy Scottish gin gifts at The Wee Gin Shop?",
            "content": "<p>Yes! We offer a range of gifts inspired by Dunrobin Castle and the North Highlands.&nbsp;</p><p>From our signature Dunrobin Gin in 20cl and 70cl bottles to premium gift sets, handmade gin chocolates created by Highland Whisky Chocolates in Golspie, and branded merchandise including hats and bags, there's something for every gin lover.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "item_x98TwA": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I visit Dunrobin Highland Distillery?",
            "content": "<p>Dunrobin Highland Distillery is a working production site at Dunrobin Farm, near Dunrobin Castle, and isn't currently open for public tours.</p><p>However, you're very welcome to visit The Wee Gin Shop at Dunrobin Castle, where our team can tell you more about the distillery, the story behind Dunrobin Gin and the botanicals that make it unique. You can also learn more about our story on our&nbsp;<a href=\"/pages/about\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"About Dunrobin Highland Distillery | Golspie, Scotland\">About Us</a>&nbsp;page.&nbsp;</p>",
            "page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        }
